    "将移除订阅源、固定分组与全部远端成员；若代理正走此订阅，代理会停止。此操作不可撤销。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将移除订阅源、固定分组与全部远端成员；若代理正走此订阅，代理会停止。此操作不可撤销。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes the subscription, its group, and all remote members. If the proxy is using this subscription, it will stop. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
